'
' Rendered to mirror-overlay.svg by 'make diagrams'. GitHub does not render
' PlantUML, so the SVG beside this file is what docs/deployment.md shows;
' regenerate it in the same commit as any edit here.
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ArrowFontSize 13

rectangle "**One tree** — root and out name the same directory\n\n""/srv/mirror/pool/""\n""   ubuntu.iso     the artifact""\n""   index.html     cairn wrote it""\n""   index.json     cairn wrote it""\n""   SHA256SUMS     cairn wrote it""\n\nrsyncs whole; sha256sum -c works where it sits" as InPlace #F7F7F5;line:444444

rectangle "**Two trees** — the web server overlays them\n\n""/srv/artifacts/pool/""\n""   ubuntu.iso     the artifact""\n\n""/srv/site/public/pool/""\n""   index.html     cairn wrote it""\n""   index.json     cairn wrote it""\n""   SHA256SUMS     cairn wrote it""\n\nthe artifact tree is never written to" as Split #F7F7F5;line:444444

rectangle "**What a client sees** — the same URLs either way\n\n""/pool/ubuntu.iso""\n""/pool/index.html""\n""/pool/index.json""\n""/pool/SHA256SUMS""" as URLs #E3ECF5;line:2F5D8C

InPlace --> URLs
Split --> URLs
@enduml
